45ce20771d9600491e9\",\"quote\":\"(B) Collection and review of data on subcontracting plans.—\",\"start\":890},{\"end\":1015,\"field\":\"context:0\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3Ada51036a061b529f2659f2e88d4489faeb17e04c33aded955b4dfbf56be27629:950:1015:sha256-1093fa67029f55942b06a0875a4420fe11be02685521c789c7d6456d5678813c\",\"quote\":\"The head of each contracting agency shall ensure that the agency—\",\"start\":950}],\"id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:revision:1bbc730be2bb9ad243c49bb579ab79e79bcb6013feb782f22a0d904c17c4f728\",\"jurisdiction\":\"\",\"jurisdiction_quote\":\"\",\"kind\":\"requirement\",\"logic_text\":\"\",\"meaning_assertion_id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:7dfeb242638144c52fff04be3f4e21c6232928c91a30cdd2ebafae6a0d19a00e\",\"modality\":\"must\",\"modality_quote\":\"shall\",\"object\":\"\",\"occurrence_id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:occurrence:46403c472b12f66b12b677fb6edd0698b1e242b75f6a629fca331606c346be76\",\"origin\":\"aiSuggested\",\"quote\":\"(ii) periodically reviews data collected and reported pursuant to clause (i) for the purpose of ensuring that such contractors comply in good faith with the requirements of this subsection.\",\"references\":[\"clause (i)\",\"this subsection\"],\"relation\":\"none\",\"rule_id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:rule:559a06c96851455ab6771fb39d31a698646d50454739f785d69433d0dad534bb\",\"scope_quotes\":[],\"scope_text\":\"\",\"section_id\":\"section-1\",\"start\":1210,\"summary\":\"The head of each contracting agency shall ensure that the agency periodically reviews data collected and reported pursuant to clause (i) for the purpose of ensuring that such contractors comply in good faith with the requirements of this subsection.\",\"target_ids\":[],\"term_refs\":[],\"typed_values\":[]}",
